      "text": "GC9A01 kijelzo 'szemek' (nincs def):\nPi SPI0 — MOSI #19, SCLK #23, CS #24,\nDC #22, RST #18, BL #16 (+3V3/GND)",
      "color": "#5a3fa0"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
